  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that the set<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8450;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>Re</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to the interval&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>]</mo></math>.</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">Re</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">Re</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">Re</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>125</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>24</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required solution.</p></blockquote>",
